              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Florida Mom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love these cookies - they are great dunkers for milk or coffee. One of my childhood friend's mother used to make these for us after school - now I know why. It's so convenient to have these waiting on you in the fridge for whenever you are ready. Thanks for the recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-06T05:09:17.160Z"
          },
          {
